[22],2014,False Alarm,Personality links to warning susceptibility,Personality/decision-trait study,Susceptibility linked to personality and decision-making traits
[23],2010,False Alarm,Does embedded training improve detection,Embedded training study,Training materially improves later phishing detection
[24],2010,False Alarm,Demographic predictors of phishing susceptibility,Demographic analysis,Age and other demographics predict susceptibility even after training
